      ],
      "text": "The bootstrap step installs agent skills, Claude Code configs/plugins/rules/statusline, Codex configs, and Ansible roles for Python, Node.js, Bun, Solidity, Docker, Kubernetes, AWS, and Google Cloud."
    },
    {
